    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"><html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><head><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"{{siteBaseUrl}}/owid-email-header.png\"/><meta content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"/><title>You&#x27;re subscribed to Our World in Data updates</title><style>\n@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {\n    .content {\n        padding-left: 16px !important;\n        padding-right: 16px !important;\n    }\n    .card {\n        padding-left: 16px !important;\n        padding-right: 16px !important;\n    }\n    .header-image {\n        line-height: 80px !important;\n    }\n}\n</style></head><body style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;margin:0;padding:0\"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style=\"display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0\" data-skip-in-text=\"true\">You&#x27;ll receive an email when we publish new work matching your preferences.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f7f7f7;color:#1d3d63;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px\"><div><!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" width=\"632\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td><![endif]--></div><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:632px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;background-color:#f7f7f7\"><tbody><tr style=\"width:100%\"><td><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:#002147\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"{{siteBaseUrl}}\" style=\"color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"header-image\" alt=\"Our World in Data Update\" height=\"132\" src=\"{{siteBaseUrl}}/owid-email-header.png\" style=\"display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;width:100%;height:auto;background-color:#002147;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:132px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-align:center\" width=\"632\"/></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"content\" style=\"padding:32px 40px 40px\"><tbody><tr><td><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#1d3d63\">You&#x27;re subscribed</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0\">Thanks for subscribing to email updates from Our World in Data! You&#x27;re all set — you&#x27;ll receive an email when we publish new work matching your preferences.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0\">These are your notification preferences:</p><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"card\" style=\"background-color:#ebeef2;padding:16px 24px\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\"><b>Topics:</b> <!-- -->{{topics}}</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\"><b>Content types:</b> <!-- -->{{contentTypes}}</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:4px 0;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0\"><b>Frequency:</b> <!-- -->{{frequency}}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:24px 0 0;margin-top:24px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\">You can<!-- --> <a href=\"{{updatePreferencesUrl}}\" style=\"color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">update your preferences</a> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <a href=\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\" style=\"color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">unsubscribe from Follow Topics</a> <!-- -->at any time — these links are also in the footer of every Follow Topics email we send.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"content\" style=\"padding:0 40px 40px;text-align:center\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#426591;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0\">This email was sent to <!-- -->{{email}}<!-- --> because you subscribed to email updates from Our World in Data.</p><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#426591;text-align:center;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0\">Our World in Data · Global Change Data Lab · Oxford, United Kingdom</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><div><!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></div></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
    "text": "{{siteBaseUrl}}\n\n\nYOU'RE SUBSCRIBED\n\nThanks for subscribing to email updates from Our World in Data! You're all set — you'll receive an email when we publish new work matching your preferences.\n\nThese are your notification preferences:\n\nTopics: {{topics}}\n\nContent types: {{contentTypes}}\n\nFrequency: {{frequency}}\n\nYou can update your preferences {{updatePreferencesUrl}} or unsubscribe from Follow Topics {{unsubscribeUrl}} at any time — these links are also in the footer of every Follow Topics email we send.\n\nThis email was sent to {{email}} because you subscribed to email updates from Our World in Data.\n\nOur World in Data · Global Change Data Lab · Oxford, United Kingdom\n\n"
